  m_text: "guess the 4-digit number:\neach digit is unique\nyou have 10 attempts\n\nafter each guess, you get feedback:\n- the first shows how many digits are in the number but in the wrong spot\n- the second shows how many digits are in the right spot\n\nexample: if the number is 3981 and you guess 2931\nyou'd see: 3 and 2\n3 \u2014 three digits (9, 3, 1) are in the number but misplaced\n2 \u2014 two digits (9, 1) are in the correct positionr"
